erson","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0299","start":299,"end":302,"surface":"丞相平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0315","start":315,"end":317,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0367","start":367,"end":369,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p004","text":"群臣以禮次侍。乃使太仆嬰與東牟侯興居清宮，奉天子法駕，迎于代邸。皇帝即日夕入未央宮。乃夜拜宋昌為衛將軍，鎮撫南北軍。以張武為郎中令，行殿中。還坐前殿。於是夜下詔書曰：「閒者諸呂用事擅權，謀為大逆，欲以危劉氏宗廟，賴將相列侯宗室大臣誅之，皆伏其辜。朕初即位，其赦天下，賜民爵一級，女子百戶牛酒，酺五日。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"太仆嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"l8e_aho_h3v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"興居","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m004-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"張武","kind":"person","person_id":"3sp_xmg_o87","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p010","text":"三月，有司請立皇后。薄太后曰：「諸侯皆同姓，立太子母為皇后。」皇后姓竇氏。上為立后故，賜天下鰥寡孤獨窮困及年八十已上孤兒九歲已下布帛米肉各有數。上從代來，初即位，施德惠天下，填撫諸侯四夷皆洽驩，乃循從代來功臣。上曰：「方大臣之誅諸呂迎朕，朕狐疑，皆止朕，唯中尉宋昌勸朕，朕以得保奉宗廟。已尊昌為衛將軍，其封昌為壯武侯。諸從朕六人，官皆至九卿。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"薄太后","kind":"person","person_id":"9zj_vf7_86a_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"竇氏","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m010-0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"昌","kind":"person","person_id":"al3_w9j_0ng","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033","text":"太祖為冠軍、徐州刺史，留鎮彭城，以曇首為府功曹。太祖鎮江陵，自功曹為長史，隨府轉鎮西長史。高祖甚知之，謂太祖曰：「王曇首，沈毅有器度，宰相才也。汝每事咨之。」景平中，有龍見西方，半天騰上，廕五綵雲，京都遠近聚觀，太史奏曰：「西方有天子氣。」太祖入奉大統，上及議者皆疑不敢下，曇首與到彥之、從兄華固勸，上猶未許。曇首又固陳，并言天人符應，上乃下。率府州文武嚴兵自衞，臺所遣百官眾力，不得近部伍，中兵參軍朱容子抱刀在平乘戶外，不解帶者數旬。既下在道，有黃龍出負上所乘舟，左右皆失色，上謂曇首曰：「此乃夏禹所以受天命，我何德以堪之。」及即位，又謂曇首曰：「非宋昌獨見，無以致此。」以曇首為侍中，尋領右衞將軍，領驍騎將軍。以朱容子為右軍將軍。誅徐羨之等，平謝晦，曇首及華之力也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"3bh_k4m_fg4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"曇首","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"3bh_k4m_fg4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"3bh_k4m_fg4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0057","start":57,"end":60,"surface":"王曇首","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"汝","kind":"person","person_id":"3bh_k4m_fg4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"太史","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"3bh_k4m_fg4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line033:m0127","start":127,"end":128,"surfac